fixture cam_run_turn
doc BUILD.md s5 feel rules "60 u horizontal lead in the facing direction, dead zone of 40x30 u"; docs/adr/0011: the lead swings smoothly and never pulls the camera against the player's motion
room test/camera
spawn 1600 3200
frames 260
input
  # Run right, stop, turn on the spot, run back left.
  0..59 R
  90 L
  120..159 L
  # A running jump right, then a strike back to the left in the air: Ash turns at once, while
  # the jump's speed bleeds off under air control (docs/adr/0010), so for a while Ash faces left
  # and moves right. The lead must not pull the camera back against that motion.
  180..199 R jump
  200..203 L attack
  204..230 L
end
expect
  at 59 vx=2304
  at 90 facing=-1
  at 159 vx=-2304
  at 180 event.jump=1
  at 200 event.attack=1 facing=-1 vx>0
  mark back 201..230 vx<0
end
